# DAF Browser fork — never commit the Chromium tree, build output, or secrets.
#
# The Chromium checkout (~100 GB), depot_tools, and the Bare reference clone
# live only on build infrastructure (a GitHub runner, or a local build host).
# They are fetched by scripts/fetch.sh and must never be pushed to this repo.
chromium/
depot_tools/
bare/
out/
state-in/
state-out/
state.tar.zst
*-logs/
*.log
*.apk
*.aab
*.keystore
*.jks
*.p12
exchange/
.DS_Store

# NOTE: no hinge verdict markers are committed to this repo. The verdict
# (HINGE_PASSED / HINGE_TIMEOUT / HINGE_DEAD, and the hop verdicts) lives
# as the `daf-verdict` workflow artifact on the run that produced it.
# build.yml gates on that artifact (via the previous run's ID), not on a
# file in the repo — so there is nothing here to un-ignore.
